{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":331003,\"title\":\"Taur the Mighty\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"The warlike men of Kixos murder the king of Surupak and abduct his two daughters, Jia and Tuja. Jia's bridegroom Syros asks the mighty warrior Taurus for assistance. Taurus faithful companion Ubaratuta will give Taurus a hand to defeat the warlike tribe.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aUl4f2orUzfO8FqnVZT6Su2mYso.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9tShJEJLQ8xXFF2z20U6kEWc3F3.jpg\",\"rating\":3.7,\"voteCount\":3,\"year\":1963,\"runtime\":95,\"genres\":[\"Adventure\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"IT\",\"name\":\"Italy\"},{\"code\":\"YU\",\"name\":\"Yugoslavia\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Antonio Leonviola\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":253671,\"name\":\"Antonio Leonviola\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":79358,\"name\":\"Joe Robinson\",\"character\":\"Taurus\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rWgknvT1yOhX3MQms8WnZjG6ote.jpg\"},{\"id\":184951,\"name\":\"Harry Baird\",\"character\":\"Ubaratutu\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/uDgl90qZWY65kcVEqcqSFEjN8mm.jpg\"},{\"id\":52254,\"name\":\"Bella Cortez\",\"character\":\"Queen Akiba\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tTWnlJ3NyStbHstWdNyvnHxfSJd.jpg\"},{\"id\":1435626,\"name\":\"Carla Foscari\",\"character\":\"Ararut\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pOoi3Mm6hF8o585OgES3uTEcdks.jpg\"},{\"id\":98493,\"name\":\"Alberto Cevenini\",\"character\":\"Syros\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1182577,\"name\":\"Janine Hendy\",\"character\":\"Afer\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":2095308,\"name\":\"Thea Fleming\",\"character\":\"Illa\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/s5uTBi7MqgO1U4xhqAASukB8GnI.jpg\"},{\"id\":1883478,\"name\":\"Claudia Capone\",\"character\":\"Tuja\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1430285,\"name\":\"Erminio Spalla\",\"character\":\"Re di Shrupuk\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":88687,\"name\":\"José Torres\",\"character\":\"El Khad\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zNeXv9O4RDfWOyFmKnbV1W4SmGU.jpg\"},{\"id\":2508131,\"name\":\"Miranda Crovato\",\"character\":\"La Regina\",\"photo\":null}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":122,\"title\":\"The Lord of the Rings: The Return of the King\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rCzpDGLbOoPwLjy3OAm5NUPOTrC.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ctiw6FZK4N36LmkjSklWEbuvlq9.jpg\",\"rating\":8.5,\"year\":2003,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"As armies mass for a final battle that will decide the fate of the world--and powerful, ancient forces of Light and Dark compete to determine the outcome--one member of the Fellowship of the Ring is revealed as the noble heir to the throne of the Kings of Men. Yet, the sole hope for triumph over evil lies with a brave hobbit, Frodo, who, accompanied by his loyal friend Sam and the hideous, wretched Gollum, ventures deep into the very dark heart of Mordor on his seemingly impossible quest to destroy the Ring of Power.​\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Fantasy\",\"Action\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":420818,\"title\":\"The Lion King\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dzBtMocZuJbjLOXvrl4zGYigDzh.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1TUg5pO1VZ4B0Q1amk3OlXvlpXV.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Simba idolizes his father, King Mufasa, and takes to heart his own royal destiny. But not everyone in the kingdom celebrates the new cub's arrival. Scar, Mufasa's brother—and former heir to the throne—has plans of his own. The battle for Pride Rock is ravaged with betrayal, tragedy and drama, ultimately resulting in Simba's exile. With help from a curious pair of newfound friends, Simba will have to figure out how to grow up and take back what is rightfully his.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Drama\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":446893,\"title\":\"Trolls World Tour\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7W0G3YECgDAfnuiHG91r8WqgIOe.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qsxhnirlp7y4Ae9bd11oYJSX59j.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2020,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Queen Poppy and Branch make a surprising discovery — there are other Troll worlds beyond their own, and their distinct differences create big clashes between these various tribes. When a mysterious threat puts all of the Trolls across the land in danger, Poppy, Branch, and their band of friends must embark on an epic quest to create harmony among the feuding Trolls to unite them against certain doom.\",\"genres\":[\"Family\",\"Animation\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":10140,\"title\":\"The Chronicles of Narnia: The Voyage of the Dawn Treader\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pP27zlm9yeKrCeDZLFLP2HKELot.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oc3be3waruLd0PB9h4bomN7Le3v.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"year\":2010,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"This time around Edmund and Lucy Pevensie, along with their pesky cousin Eustace Scrubb find themselves swallowed into a painting and on to a fantastic Narnian ship headed for the very edges of the world.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Family\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":639933,\"title\":\"The Northman\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aSSJMnHknzKjlZ6zybwD7eyJ4Po.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fMiEp00v8gGWEceL4QeLu6H6z69.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Prince Amleth is on the verge of becoming a man when his father is brutally murdered by his uncle, who kidnaps the boy's mother. Two decades later, Amleth is now a Viking who's on a mission to save his mother, kill his uncle and avenge his father.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":68735,\"title\":\"Warcraft\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/eGi5aoxaZveqNLtE7BZJCuWwR3G.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/aTGvZ3F8QnAD8cPpJRaaqRRxFK6.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"year\":2016,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The peaceful realm of Azeroth stands on the brink of war as its civilization faces a fearsome race of invaders: orc warriors fleeing their dying home to colonize another. As a portal opens to connect the two worlds, one army faces destruction and the other faces extinction. From opposing sides, two heroes are set on a collision course that will decide the fate of their family, their people, and their home.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":948713,\"title\":\"The Last Kingdom: Seven Kings Must Die\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qcNDxDzd5OW9wE3c8nWxCBQoBrM.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kEhCztSTP4ixu7R0AIWg8vvcvbb.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2023,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In the wake of King Edward's death, Uhtred of Bebbanburg and his comrades adventure across a fractured kingdom in the hopes of uniting England at last.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"War\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":11469,\"title\":\"Black Knight\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pVxwVH461k9u4tUfRewT29DEZ2e.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/udgq4FDqsRgJIACUrWlk1BRtUhf.jpg\",\"rating\":5.5,\"year\":2001,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After nearly drowning, an employee working at a medieval amusement park awakens to find himself in 14th century England.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Fantasy\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":38319,\"title\":\"Your Highness\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bq3gU60TkgBjLUbxSSZVhDhlhmH.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7P7aZ9ozRWlsruPVaTB2dLXI7aF.jpg\",\"rating\":5.3,\"year\":2011,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A fantasy movie about an arrogant, lazy prince and his more heroic brother who must complete a quest in order to save their father's kingdom.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Fantasy\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":554805,\"title\":\"Kingdom\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/psMD1c4puVlU38LUKDUH6kRtxNy.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sx9dBw5dvbXtXIx2mO9VyzujgS2.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Set in Qin Dynasty during the warring states period in ancient China. Shin was a war orphan. He has a dream of becoming a great general Shin has a fateful encounter with young King Eisei. King Eisei aims to unify all of China.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"War\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":413658,\"title\":\"The Warriors Gate\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8l2DHcrCTgy1XuFHZmL2BbClJVO.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rpsuxOvGgVBKmQELkPPNigjW9qO.jpg\",\"rating\":6.6,\"year\":2016,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After a mysterious chest opens a gateway through time, teen gamer Jack is transported to an ancient empire terrorized by a cruel barbarian king. Jack will need all of his gaming skills as he battles to defeat the barbarian, protect a beautiful princess, and somehow find his way back home.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":38543,\"title\":\"Ironclad\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/h7CP12wAThhw2WSOA1uIAqxg1fS.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rprg34i9MfIRAJdBcjAWaV7JXRe.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"year\":2011,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In the year 1215, the rebel barons of England have forced their despised King John to put his royal seal on the Magna Carta, a seminal document that upheld the rights of free men. Yet within months of pledging himself to the great charter, the King reneged on his word and assembled a mercenary army on the south coast of England with the intention of bringing the barons and the country back under his tyrannical rule. Barring his way stood the mighty Rochester 